Subject: [PATCH] feat(core): Resize of rank-3 tensors

[N, C, W] is the 1-D upsampling of audio decoders (Kokoro, StyleTTS 2).
It runs the 2-D kernel with H = 1; scales and sizes of length 3 get the
unit H entry.

